# Phase 1 hand patches (format: tools/reorg/patches.py). Paths are AFTER the move, and the
# old text is what the path rewriter has already produced.

# The generated pages link the .md they are rendered from. Relative .md links worked only
# while the site and the docs shared docs/; they become github.com blob URLs, so they work
# from GitHub Pages, from site/ (phase 3) and from a local server alike.
